OL,3,ABurnham pledges devolution deals and
OL,4,A'stronger public control' of services
OL,5,Ain first address to MPs
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking about changes made to the
OL,8,Fgovernment's early prisoner release
OL,9,Fscheme, Burnham says he has heard
OL,10,Fconcerns and the policy will "balance
OL,11,Fpublic safety and basic fairness"
OL,13,FHe also pays tribute to his predecessor
OL,14,FKeir Starmer - who earlier announced he
OL,15,Fwill stand down as an MP - for a
OL,16,F"lifetime of public service", and
OL,17,Fpledges to continue his support for
OL,18,FUkraine
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
