OL,3,ANepal death toll crosses 1,000 as
OL,4,Arescuers race to find workers trapped
OL,5,Ain mud-filled tunnels
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe death toll in Nepal from
OL,8,Fdevastating floods on the border with
OL,9,FTibet has crossed 1,000, according to
OL,10,Fthe country's disaster agency.
OL,12,FMore than 3,900 people remain missing -
OL,13,Fof whom more than 600 are workers
OL,14,Fbelieved to be trapped in a vast
OL,15,Fnetwork of mud-filled tunnels at
OL,16,Fhydropower sites along Trishuli River.
OL,18,FEngineers have been pumping air into
OL,19,Fthe tunnels - and while a team did
OL,20,Fmanage to gain entry to one of them, it
OL,21,Fwithdrew after finding no-one there.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
